        "original_id": "de5e20af-dde2-5da5-80ff-f19c588e4b08",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ed Wood, Fernand Rivers, Bela Lugosi, Dolores Fuller\n- Films: Glen or Glenda\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, director, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Fernand Rivers, born François Large on 6 September 1879 in Saint-Lager, was a French actor, screenwriter, film producer, and director.\n- Ed Wood, born Edward Davis Wood Jr. on October 10, 1924, was an American filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, and director.\n- Glen or Glenda is a 1953 American drama film written, directed by, and starring Ed Wood, who was credited in the starring role as \"Daniel Davis\".\n- Glen or Glenda features Bela Lugosi and Ed Wood's then-girlfriend Dolores Fuller.\n- Fernand Rivers died on 12 September 1960.\n- Ed Wood died on December 10, 1978.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
